      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Reviewed in today's committer meeting, is candidate for discussion in special topics meeting 3/10</p>\n\n<p>People who might be interested:<br/>\n  Hydra folks (lightweight workflow)<br/>\n  Asger (using states to support content model rules)</p>\n\n<p>See also \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-424\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-424\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Workflow Engine Integration\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-424\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (Workflow integration)</p>",
     "created": "03/Mar/09 12:14 PM",
